C ELM38E              DIMENSIONS OF MAGNET AS SEEN ON PLOT
C
C DAW       HORIZONTAL PLOT DIMENSION FROM MAGNET WIDTH
C DUW       VERTICAL PLOT DIMENSION FROM MAGNET WIDTH
C DAH       HORIZONTAL PLOT DIMENSION FROM MAGNET HEIGHT
C DUH       VERTICAL PLOT DIMENSION FROM MAGNET HEIGHT
C DAL       HORIZINTAL PLOT DIMENSION FROM MAGNET LENGTH
C DUL       VERTICAL PLOT DIMENSION FROM MAGNET LENGTH
C SAGIT     SAGITTA OFFSET FOR RBEND
C
      REAL            DAW, DUW, DAH, DUH, DAL, DUL, SAGIT
C
      COMMON /ELM38E/ DAW, DUW, DAH, DUH, DAL, DUL, SAGIT
